# Backend used by the deployed frontend (Vercel). Not a secret.
# "/backend" = same-origin proxy configured in next.config.ts (Vercel forwards to BACKEND_ORIGIN,
# default https://floor-inspection-api.onrender.com). No CORS, and blocks on the backend domain do not matter.
# Your PC via ngrok remains available: run "Launch Floor Inspection AI.bat" (opens the app with ?backend=...).
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=/backend
